<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ReliaStar raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ReliaStar raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded ReliaStar Financial Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 operating earnings estimate to $5.15 per share from $5.10 and 1998 estimate to $5.90 from $5.70.</p>
<p>-- Said 1998 estimate increase reflects benefits from Security-Connecticut merger and more optmistic outlook for business mix.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-5/8 to 62-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
